{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the sequence\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddb98ab5cb4c79e636eebd6161fcdfea100f7c3c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[..., a, b, c, d, 0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8,...\\]\" width=\"222\" height=\"16\" />\neach term is the sum of the two terms to its left. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/22274b2a65643f4f1a12bbe5e86ce885465555b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We work backwards to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c724e486f574487b2413594589cfb1a73d8a632.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d+0=1\\implies d=1\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"14\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/9/a499bb1932a96cd062ebfa9e1fa6f9b0bd3f502f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c+1=0\\implies c=-1\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/37674399b748d7e4b60e93a9790d9169e56121d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b+(-1)=1\\implies b=2\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/c/6ecfa8e3b9d5460463735971957381c83183ff10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+2=-1\\implies a=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}-3.}\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=